s the FHIR ConformanceExpectation verb: SHALL, SHOULD, MAY or SHOULD-NOT. Across the 41 committed instances it is 155 SHALL and 15 SHOULD. successCriteria is a LIST of objects, each {key, criterion, verification}: `key` is unique within the statement (e.g. SC-1), `criterion` is a checkable sentence, and `verification` is one of test | inspection | review | analysis -- the same field name and enum as folio-assistant's requirement.ts `successCriteria`, so the two map 1:1. smart-base types it, so the shape is enforced by the schema; a statement with no successCriteria is still valid (the 170 statements committed in smart-base carry none). Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/requirement-statement.\">KGRequirementStatement</a><a name=\"fr-KGRequirementStatement\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://build.fhir.org/types.html#Base\">Base</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Knowledge graph L2: Requirement Statement</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Type de donnée primitif\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">KGRequirementStatement.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-KGRequirementStatement-definitions.ht