nt\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Requirement</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"نوع البيانات البدائية\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">KGRequirementStatement.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-KGRequirementStatement-definitions.html#KGRequirementStatement.conformance\" title=\"The FHIR ConformanceExpectation verb: SHALL, SHOULD, MAY or SHOULD-NOT.\">conformance</a><a name=\"ar-KGRequirementStatement.conformance\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\">code</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Conformance<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">التجليد: </span><a href=\"ValueSet-KGConformanceExpectationVS.html\" title=\"http://smart.who.int/base/ValueSet/KGConformanceExpectationVS\" class=\"binding\">Knowledge graph L2: conformance expectation</a><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/terminologies.html#required\" title=\"To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the